Wordwise
********

Wordwise is a reading aid inspired by (and an homage to) Amazon Kindle's
_Word Wise_ feature.  When ‘wordwise-mode’ is active, uncommon English
words in the buffer get a short dictionary definition displayed on a
phantom line above the word, so you can keep reading without breaking
flow to look something up.

   This manual is for Wordwise version 0.1.0, an Emacs package providing
