2 Installation
**************

Wordwise requires Emacs 27.1 or later and has no third-party
dependencies.

   With ‘use-package’ and ‘package-vc’ (Emacs 29+):

     (use-package wordwise
       :vc (:url "https://github.com/systemhalted/wordwise.el"
            :rev :newest)
       :bind ("C-c w" . wordwise-mode))

   Interactively:

     M-x package-vc-install RET https://github.com/systemhalted/wordwise.el RET

   Or manually: clone the repository, add its directory to ‘load-path’,
and ‘(require 'wordwise)’.

   Wordwise defines no keybindings of its own; bind ‘wordwise-mode’ to a
key of your choosing, as in the ‘use-package’ example above.


