4 Difficulty Levels
*******************

The user option ‘wordwise-difficulty’ (default 3) decides how rare a
word must be to earn an annotation.  The bundled frequency list assigns
each of its ~9,500 words to a tier from 1 (most common) to 5 (least
common); words absent from the list entirely are treated as rarer still.

Level       Annotates
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
1           Only words absent from the entire frequency list.
2           Words outside the top ~10,000.
3           Words outside the top ~5,000 (the default).
4           Words outside the top ~3,000.
5           Anything outside the top ~1,000 -- the most annotations.

   Change it interactively with ‘M-x wordwise-set-difficulty’, which
rescans immediately, or set it in your init file:

     (setq wordwise-difficulty 4)


