5 Customization
***************

All options live in the ‘wordwise’ customization group (‘M-x
customize-group RET wordwise’).

‘wordwise-difficulty’
     Annotation aggressiveness, 1-5.  *Note Difficulty Levels::.

‘wordwise-allowed-modes’
     Major modes in which the mode may be enabled.  Default: ‘(org-mode
     nov-mode markdown-mode gfm-mode eww-mode)’.  Derived modes count.
     Enabling the mode elsewhere prints a message and does nothing.

‘wordwise-max-hint-length’
     Maximum length of a hint line, in characters (default 50).  Longer
     definitions are truncated with an ellipsis.

‘wordwise-request-timeout’
     Seconds to wait for one DICT response before treating the request
     as failed (default 5).

‘wordwise-ignored-words’
     Words never to annotate.  Usually maintained with ‘M-x
     wordwise-ignore-word’, which saves through Customize; you can also
     edit the list directly.

   The hint text uses the face ‘wordwise-hint-face’, which by default
inherits from ‘shadow’ at 70% height.  Customize it to change the hint
color or size.


